g. \"focus on security\"). Selecting one agent or passing `--agent` runs the single-agent path; selecting two or more runs the N-agent path.\n\n#### Settings Schema\n\nReview skills are configured per-agent in `.entire/settings.json`:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"review\": {\n    \"claude-code\": {\"skills\": [\"/pr-review-toolkit:review-pr\"], \"prompt\": \"Be thorough.\"},\n    \"codex\": {\"skills\": [\"/codex:adversarial-review\"]}\n  }\n}\n```\n\nThe key is the agent name. The value is a `ReviewConfig` with `s","truncation_policy":{"mode":"tokens","limit":10000}}}
